IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `coa-core`
IMPORT `coa17-helpers`
IMPORT `coa17-part21a-ch2-company`

-- coa17-tests-part21a-ch2-company.l4: tests for ss 790CB-790F (coa17-part21a-ch2-company.l4). Expected values are written by
-- hand from the text of the section named beside each group. "G" below is the answer of s 790B(1) (this Part applies).

§ `Tests: Part 21A Chapter 2, duties on companies`

-- ---- s 790CB: a company to which this Part applies must take reasonable steps -----------------------------------------
#ASSERT `s 790CB the company must take reasonable steps to find out if there is anyone who is a registrable person or a registrable relevant legal entity and, if so, to identify them` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790CB the company must take reasonable steps to find out if there is anyone who is a registrable person or a registrable relevant legal entity and, if so, to identify them` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790CB the company must take reasonable steps to find out if there is anyone who is a registrable person or a registrable relevant legal entity and, if so, to identify them` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 790CB the company has taken reasonable steps` (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790CB the company has taken reasonable steps` (JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790CB the company has taken reasonable steps` NOTHING FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790CB the company has taken reasonable steps` NOTHING TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 790CB the company has taken reasonable steps` (JUST FALSE) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- ---- s 790D ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- (5) not required if (a) the incorporation statement named the person and (b) no cause to believe they have since ceased
#ASSERT `s 790D(5) the company is not required to give a notice to the person under this section` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790D(5) the company is not required to give a notice to the person under this section` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790D(5) the company is not required to give a notice to the person under this section` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (1) must give a notice if (a) it knows or has cause to believe, but (b) it has not had confirmation of the status, or of all the particulars
#ASSERT `s 790D(1) the company must give a notice to the person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790D(1) the company must give a notice to the person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790D(1) the company must give a notice to the person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790D(1) the company must give a notice to the person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790D(1) the company must give a notice to the person` (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790D(1) the company must give a notice to the person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790D(1) the company must give a notice to the person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790D(1) the company must give a notice to the person` (JUST FALSE) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790D(1) the company must give a notice to the person` NOTHING TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 790D(1) the company must give a notice to the person` NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (2) the content of the notice
#ASSERT `s 790D(2) the notice requires what this subsection requires` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790D(2) the notice requires what this subsection requires` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790D(2) the notice requires what this subsection requires` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (3) one month beginning with the day the notice is given: 5 January gives 4 February; 31 January gives 28 February
#ASSERT `s 790D(3) the last day for the person to comply with the notice` (Date 5 1 2026) EQUALS Date 4 2 2026
#ASSERT `s 790D(3) the last day for the person to comply with the notice` (Date 31 1 2026) EQUALS Date 28 2 2026
#ASSERT `s 790D(3) the notice requires compliance within the period` (Date 5 1 2026) (Date 4 2 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790D(3) the notice requires compliance within the period` (Date 5 1 2026) (Date 20 1 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790D(3) the notice requires compliance within the period` (Date 5 1 2026) (Date 5 2 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (4) 14 days beginning with the day the company becomes subject to the duty: 5 January gives 18 January
#ASSERT `s 790D(4)(b) the last day for the company to give the notice` (Date 5 1 2026) EQUALS Date 18 1 2026
#ASSERT `s 790D(4) the company has given the notice in time` (Date 5 1 2026) (JUST (Date 18 1 2026)) TRUE (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790D(4) the company has given the notice in time` (Date 5 1 2026) (JUST (Date 19 1 2026)) TRUE (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790D(4) the company has given the notice in time` (Date 5 1 2026) (JUST (Date 10 1 2026)) FALSE (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790D(4) the company has given the notice in time` (Date 5 1 2026) NOTHING TRUE (Date 18 1 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 790D(4) the company has given the notice in time` (Date 5 1 2026) NOTHING TRUE (Date 19 1 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE

