-- (2) (a) indictment: two years or a fine (or both); (b)(i) E&W: twelve months or a fine (or both); (ii) Scotland: twelve months or a fine not exceeding the statutory maximum (or both); (iii) NI: six months or the same fine (or both)
#ASSERT `s 790F(2) the penalty` `on conviction on indictment` EQUALS JUST (Penalty WITH `how convicted` IS `on conviction on indictment`, `imprisonment not exceeding` IS JUST (Period OF 2, Years), `fine not exceeding` IS JUST `a fine without a stated limit`, `daily default fine for continued contravention` IS NOTHING, `imprisonment and fine together` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 790F(2) the penalty` `on summary conviction in England and Wales` EQUALS JUST (Penalty WITH `how convicted` IS `on summary conviction in England and Wales`, `imprisonment not exceeding` IS JUST (Period OF 12, Months), `fine not exceeding` IS JUST `a fine without a stated limit`, `daily default fine for continued contravention` IS NOTHING, `imprisonment and fine together` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 790F(2) the penalty` `on summary conviction in Scotland` EQUALS JUST (Penalty WITH `how convicted` IS `on summary conviction in Scotland`, `imprisonment not exceeding` IS JUST (Period OF 12, Months), `fine not exceeding` IS JUST (`a fine not exceeding the statutory maximum` OF 1), `daily default fine for continued contravention` IS NOTHING, `imprisonment and fine together` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 790F(2) the penalty` `on summary conviction in Northern Ireland` EQUALS JUST (Penalty WITH `how convicted` IS `on summary conviction in Northern Ireland`, `imprisonment not exceeding` IS JUST (Period OF 6, Months), `fine not exceeding` IS JUST (`a fine not exceeding the statutory maximum` OF 1), `daily default fine for continued contravention` IS NOTHING, `imprisonment and fine together` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 790F(2) the penalty` `on summary conviction` EQUALS NOTHING
